# Diagnostics written by the app itself
#
# The log records the full path of every file the parser is asked about, so committing it publishes
# the contents of a private music library — folder names, file names and all.
_crash.txt
aurora-diagnostics.log
*.flag

# Signing material must never be committed: a .pfx holds a private key.
*.pfx
*.cer
*.snk

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distribution artifacts, spelled out explicitly.
#
# The installer is 147.92 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, and pushing
# it would be rejected outright. It is a Release asset, not repository content.
# The patterns above ([Bb]in/, *.user, *.suo, *.pfx) already cover the rest of
# these; they are repeated here so the intent survives any future narrowing of
# those globs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
.vs/
.user
.suo

# Installer output: too large for the repository, and rebuildable from source.
installer/Output/

# Signing material: a .pfx holds a private key.
*_cert.pfx

# Diagnostics written by the app itself, which name the user's own files.
_crash.txt